1
00:00:00,001 --> 00:00:01,870
Buddha in GTA 6,

2
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:03,727
the most violent game ever made,

3
00:00:03,747 --> 00:00:04,403
played by a man who

4
00:00:04,423 --> 00:00:05,346
has sworn he will never

5
00:00:05,366 --> 00:00:06,925
hurt a single living thing.

6
00:00:07,062 --> 00:00:07,788
The game drops him onto

7
00:00:07,808 --> 00:00:08,970
a street soaked in neon,

8
00:00:08,990 --> 00:00:09,831
and the very first mission

9
00:00:09,851 --> 00:00:11,440
flashes up on the screen:

10
00:00:11,512 --> 00:00:12,694
steal this car.

11
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:14,202
So he walks up to the owner,

12
00:00:14,222 --> 00:00:15,396
looks him calmly in the eye,

13
00:00:15,416 --> 00:00:16,461
and places the car keys back

14
00:00:16,481 --> 00:00:17,930
into the man's shaking hand.

15
00:00:17,986 --> 00:00:19,325
Instead of a red wanted star,

16
00:00:19,345 --> 00:00:19,996
a golden one lights

17
00:00:20,016 --> 00:00:20,974
up on the screen,

18
00:00:20,994 --> 00:00:21,559
and the owner,

19
00:00:21,579 --> 00:00:22,528
completely lost,

20
00:00:22,548 --> 00:00:24,440
starts quietly following him down the street.

21
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:25,548
That's when a gang closes in from

22
00:00:25,568 --> 00:00:27,165
every side with their guns raised,

23
00:00:27,185 --> 00:00:29,077
and the game flashes its only instruction:

24
00:00:29,128 --> 00:00:30,162
pick up a weapon.

25
00:00:30,184 --> 00:00:31,389
Now the choice is yours,

26
00:00:31,409 --> 00:00:32,376
run for your life or fight the

27
00:00:32,396 --> 00:00:33,840
way the game wants you to,

28
00:00:33,948 --> 00:00:35,169
but Buddha does neither.

29
00:00:35,189 --> 00:00:36,418
He sits down cross-legged in the middle

30
00:00:36,438 --> 00:00:38,071
of the road and closes his eyes,

31
00:00:38,091 --> 00:00:39,810
and even with the whole street screaming,

32
00:00:39,830 --> 00:00:41,282
his breathing never changes.

33
00:00:41,302 --> 00:00:42,382
The gang leader walks right up and

34
00:00:42,402 --> 00:00:43,813
points his gun at his face,

35
00:00:43,833 --> 00:00:44,233
and for the first

36
00:00:44,212 --> 00:00:45,234
time in this game,

37
00:00:45,254 --> 00:00:46,593
nobody pulls the trigger.

38
00:00:46,624 --> 00:00:48,146
One by one the guns come down,

39
00:00:48,166 --> 00:00:49,030
until the whole city has

40
00:00:49,050 --> 00:00:50,182
stopped just to watch a man

41
00:00:50,202 --> 00:00:51,585
sitting quietly in the road.

42
00:00:51,605 --> 00:00:53,226
If you were dropped into GTA 6,

43
00:00:53,246 --> 00:00:53,646
could you play it

44
00:00:53,591 --> 00:00:54,601
the way Buddha did?

45
00:00:54,644 --> 00:00:55,664
Tell me in the comments.
